%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#1a202c', 'primaryTextColor':'#ffffff', 'primaryBorderColor':'#2d3748', 'lineColor':'#4a5568', 'fontSize':'11px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 📱 Client
    participant REST as 🌐 REST API
    participant gRPC as ⚡ gRPC API  
    participant Handler as 🔧 UnifiedHandlers
    participant DVS as ⚡ DirectVectorService
    participant CS as 🗃️ CollectionService
    participant Engine as 🗄️ StorageEngine
    participant VIPER as 🏗️ VIPER Engine
    participant SST as 🧱 SST Engine
    participant Atomic as ⚛️ AtomicCoordinator
    participant Cloud as ☁️ Cloud Storage
    
    %% Vector Insert Flow
    Note over Client,Cloud: Vector Insert Operation (49K ops/sec)
    
    Client->>+REST: POST /vectors<br/>📦 JSON Batch (500 vectors)
    REST->>+Handler: handle_vector_batch()<br/>🔄 JSON → Proto
    Handler->>+DVS: insert_vectors()<br/>⚡ Direct Access
    DVS->>+Engine: route_to_engine()<br/>🎯 Collection-based Routing
    
    alt VIPER Engine Selected
        Engine->>+VIPER: insert_batch()<br/>🏗️ Columnar Storage
        VIPER->>+Atomic: begin_atomic_operation()<br/>⚛️ ACID Transaction
        Atomic->>+Cloud: write_to_staging()<br/>💾 Staged Write
        Cloud-->>-Atomic: ✅ Write Confirmed
        Atomic-->>-VIPER: ✅ Transaction ID
        VIPER-->>-Engine: ✅ Insert Complete
    else SST Engine Selected  
        Engine->>+SST: insert_batch()<br/>🧱 Row-based Storage
        SST->>+Atomic: begin_atomic_operation()<br/>⚛️ ACID Transaction
        Atomic->>+Cloud: write_sstables()<br/>💾 SSTable Write
        Cloud-->>-Atomic: ✅ Write Confirmed
        Atomic-->>-SST: ✅ Transaction ID
        SST-->>-Engine: ✅ Insert Complete
    end
    
    Engine-->>-DVS: ✅ Batch Inserted
    DVS-->>-Handler: ✅ Operation Result
    Handler-->>-REST: ✅ Proto → JSON Response
    REST-->>-Client: 📊 Insert Stats<br/>⏱️ <5ms Response Time
    
    %% Vector Search Flow
    Note over Client,Cloud: Vector Search Operation (48 QPS)
    
    Client->>+gRPC: SearchVectors()<br/>⚡ Binary Proto Query
    gRPC->>+Handler: handle_vector_search()<br/>🔄 Direct Proto
    Handler->>+DVS: search_vectors()<br/>🎯 Query Optimization
    DVS->>+Engine: multi_engine_search()<br/>🔍 Parallel Search
    
    par VIPER Search
        Engine->>+VIPER: vector_search()<br/>🏗️ Columnar Scan
        VIPER-->>-Engine: 📊 VIPER Results
    and SST Search
        Engine->>+SST: range_search()<br/>🧱 Row-based Scan  
        SST-->>-Engine: 📊 SST Results
    end
    
    Engine->>Engine: merge_and_rank()<br/>📊 Score Normalization
    Engine-->>-DVS: 🎯 Top-K Results
    DVS-->>-Handler: ✅ Search Complete
    Handler-->>-gRPC: ⚡ Direct Proto Response
    gRPC-->>-Client: 🔍 Search Results<br/>⏱️ <10ms p95
    
    %% Collection Management Flow
    Note over Client,Cloud: Collection Operations
    
    Client->>+REST: POST /collections<br/>🗃️ Collection Config
    REST->>+Handler: handle_collection_operation()<br/>🔄 JSON → Proto
    Handler->>+CS: create_collection()<br/>🏗️ Metadata Setup
    CS->>+Engine: initialize_storage()<br/>📁 Directory Creation
    Engine->>+Atomic: setup_collection_storage()<br/>⚛️ Atomic Setup
    Atomic->>+Cloud: create_collection_dirs()<br/>📁 Cloud Directories
    Cloud-->>-Atomic: ✅ Directories Created
    Atomic-->>-Engine: ✅ Storage Ready
    Engine-->>-CS: ✅ Collection Initialized
    CS-->>-Handler: ✅ Collection Created
    Handler-->>-REST: ✅ Proto → JSON Response
    REST-->>-Client: 🗃️ Collection Details
    
    %% Error Handling Flow
    Note over Client,Cloud: Error Handling & Recovery
    
    Client->>+gRPC: InsertVectors()<br/>❌ Invalid Data Format
    gRPC->>+Handler: handle_vector_batch()
    Handler->>Handler: validate_proto()<br/>🔍 Schema Validation
    Handler-->>-gRPC: ❌ ValidationError<br/>📋 Detailed Error Info
    gRPC-->>-Client: ❌ Error Response<br/>🔧 Actionable Message